# Kandelo patch rationale (O12)
#
# Node's vm.measureMemory needs its original result fields, grouping and
# ranges with actual SpiderMonkey measurements. Reuse one original V8 result
# builder and connect only its object/value construction to bridge helpers;
# the former duplicate formatter is removed. V8's heap sampler cannot read
# SpiderMonkey, while OS totals cannot substitute for per-context JS usage.
#
# Source-only cleanup; normal package and consumer qualification remain required.

